      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**খ) আয়তন (Volume) = $AB \\times AD \\times AA'$ ঘন একক = $abc$ ঘন একক**",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "AB \\times AD \\times AA'",
        "abc"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 298,
      "pdfPageEnd": 298,
      "printedPageStart": 293,
      "printedPageEnd": 293,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c13-t13.8-p010",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**গ) কর্ণ $BD' = \\sqrt{BD^2 + DD'^2} = \\sqrt{AB^2 + AD^2 + DD'^2} = \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2 + c^2}$ একক**",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "BD' = \\sqrt{BD^2 + DD'^2} = \\sqrt{AB^2 + AD^2 + DD'^2} = \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2 + c^2}"
      ],
